  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.19 “Non-compliance” means the failure to comply with an applicable law, rule, or code, as defined by Saf-C 3303.01, pertaining to modular buildings.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
